1
00:00:00,204 --> 00:00:05,414
(Sheldon:)...do you truly believe that you
were ever fit to be a cheer leader?

2
00:00:09,964 --> 00:00:12,634
Look, I just don't think
that the guys and Leonard...

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,050
(Penny:)...really meant to hurt you.
They just told an unfortunate lie...

4
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:19,850
(Penny:)...to deal with a difficult situation.
You know what it's like?

5
00:00:20,016 --> 00:00:23,226
Remember the new Star Trek movie?
Kirk has to take over the ship...

6
00:00:23,394 --> 00:00:25,644
...so he tells Spock stuff
he knew wasn't true.

7
00:00:25,813 --> 00:00:29,023
(Penny:)Like saying Spock didn't care
his mom died.

8
00:00:29,525 --> 00:00:32,615
(Sheldon:)I missed Comic-Con
and the new Star Trek movie?

9
00:00:32,778 --> 00:00:34,108
[SOBBING]

10
00:00:36,532 --> 00:00:39,412
(Raj:)-I like the new look.
-Thanks.

11
00:00:42,455 --> 00:00:44,205
(Howard:)I call it the Clooney.

12
00:00:45,666 --> 00:00:48,376
(Raj:)I call it the Mario and Luigi,
but whatever.

13
00:00:48,544 --> 00:00:50,044
[LEONARD CHUCKLES]

14
00:00:50,588 --> 00:00:51,968
(Raj:)Hey, how's Sheldon doing?

15
00:00:52,131 --> 00:00:54,841
(Leonard:)He came out of his room
wearing his Darth Vader helmet...

16
00:00:55,009 --> 00:01:00,019
(Leonard:)...and tried to choke me to death
with the Force, so I'd say a little better.

